    {
      "name": "4. Multiplas instancias",
      "description": "Rode esta pasta no Collection Runner com 8 iteracoes: o header X-Instance-Id deve alternar entre api1 e api2 (ve-se no Console do Postman).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 Qual instancia respondeu?",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
